        "title": "inHarmony Meditation Cushion",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>The inHarmony Meditation Cushion was designed to help you meditate deeper and relieve stress and anxiety quickly <em>through vibro-tactile stimulation.</em></p><p>The cushion uses sound therapy and music vibration to penetrate your body to facilitate a deeper meditative state for faster and longer. </p><p>The inHarmony Meditation Cushion makes meditation more fun and uses vibroacoustic sound to help meditation feel incredible so you can maintain the habit. </p><p>It also helps increase your focus and mental clarity, allowing you to clear your mind and control your thoughts through a meditation practice.</p><p>Using the cushion can reduce anxiety and stress, giving you space to find peace of mind that allows you to truly be yourself. </p><p>The magic of the patented system of tech-assisted sound and vibration therapies will help you reach a deeply relaxed state and overall better well-being.</p>",
